  "content": "[Intro]\n[Amaj7]\"He hath\n[G#m7]come to the\n[F#m7]bosom of his be-\n[E]loved\n[Amaj7]Smiling on\n[G#m7]him, she\n[F#m7]beareth him [A6]to\n[A][C#m/A]highest [C7]heav'n\n[Bbmaj7]With\nyearning [C7/Bb]heart\"\n[Bbmaj7]\"On\nthee we [C7/Bb]gaze,\nO' goldwing'd\n[Am7]messenger of\n[Am][C]mighty [E]Gods\"\n\n[Break]\n[Dm]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Dm]Goldwing\nangel\nGo home,\ndon't tell\nAnyone\nwhat you are\nYou're sacred\nand they're starved\nAnd their art\nis gettin' dark\nAnd there you are\nto tear apart\nTear apart,\ntear apart,\ntear apart\nYou better keep your head\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bbmaj7]downdown Dada-\n[Gm7]downdown, dada-\n[Dm]downdown\nBetter keep your head\n[Bbmaj7]downdown Dada-\n[Gm7]downdown, dada-\n[Dm]downdown\nThey're gonna\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dm]tell you what you wan-\nna hear Then they're\ngonna disappear\nGonna\nclaim you like a sou-\nvenir Just to\nsell you in a year\nYou better keep your head\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bbmaj7]downdown Dada-\n[Gm7]downdown, dada-\n[Dm]downdown\nKeep your head\n[Bbmaj7]downdown Dada-\n[Gm7]downdown, dada-\n[Dm]downdown\nBetter keep your head\n[Bbmaj7]downdown Dada-\n[Gm7]downdown, dada-\n[Dm]downdown\nKeep your head\n[Bbmaj7]downdown Dada-\n[Gm7]downdown, dada-\n[Dm]downdown\nThat's good!",
